 tools/kanban_tools.py                         | 24 +++------
 tools/kanban_tools_completion.py              | 42 ++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/kanban_tools_completion.py

